<!doctype html>
<html lang="ms">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
<title>Masta Xul — Ujian Worker Login</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#090d18;--panel:#111a2b;--line:#293650;--text:#edf3ff;--muted:#9aabc7;--accent:#75a7ff;--good:#6fe0b0;--bad:#ff8d9b;--warn:#ffd27a}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;padding:24px 14px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top,#18284a 0,var(--bg) 58%);color:var(--text);font:15px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}main{width:min(760px,100%);margin:auto}header{margin:6px 0 22px}.eyebrow{color:var(--accent);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase}h1{margin:5px 0 8px;font-size:clamp(25px,5vw,36px);line-height:1.15}p{color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0}.panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:17px;padding:18px;margin:14px 0;box-shadow:0 14px 40px #0002}label{display:block;font-weight:700;margin:12px 0 6px}input{width:100%;border:1px solid #3b4d6c;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 13px;background:#080f1e;color:var(--text);font:inherit}input:focus{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}.buttons{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:14px}button{border:1px solid #45608c;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 14px;color:var(--text);background:#1b2b49;font:inherit;font-weight:750;cursor:pointer}button.primary{background:#2b5eb3;border-color:#477ed4}button:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:wait}.status{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-weight:750}.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--warn)}.good{color:var(--good)}.good .dot{background:var(--good)}.bad{color:var(--bad)}.bad .dot{background:var(--bad)}.warn{color:var(--warn)}pre{margin:10px 0 0;min-height:105px;max-height:330px;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#070b13;padding:13px;border-radius:10px;color:#d6e3ff;font:12px/1.6 ui-monospace,monospace}.hint{border-left:3px solid var(--warn);padding-left:12px}.small{font-size:12px}code{color:#c7dcff;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
</style></head>
<body><main>
<header><div class="eyebrow">Masta Xul · Test environment</div><h1>Ujian Worker Login</h1><p>Halaman ujian berasingan untuk memeriksa endpoint Worker. Ia tidak mengubah dashboard produksi dan tidak menyimpan kata laluan.</p></header>
<section class="panel"><div id="status" class="status warn"><span class="dot"></span><span>Belum diuji</span></div>
<label for="worker">URL Worker</label><input id="worker" type="url" value="https://admin-login.2ulfpv.workers.dev" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="url">
<label for="password">Kata laluan admin untuk ujian</label><input id="password" type="password" placeholder="Masukkan kata laluan — tidak disimpan" autocomplete="current-password">
<div class="buttons"><button class="primary" id="login">1. Uji login</button><button id="session">2. Semak session</button><button id="logout">3. Logout</button><button id="clear">Kosongkan log</button></div></section>
<section class="panel"><strong>Keputusan ujian</strong><pre id="output" aria-live="polite">Tekan “Semak session” untuk mula. Jika pelayar memaparkan ralat CORS, semak tetapan CORS Worker untuk origin halaman ujian ini.</pre></section>
<section class="panel"><strong>Nota penting</strong><p class="hint">Jika halaman ini dibuka terus sebagai fail <code>file://</code>, pelayar mungkin menghantar origin <code>null</code> dan menyekat permintaan. Untuk ujian sebenar, hoskan fail ini pada HTTPS dan benarkan origin tersebut dalam CORS Worker.</p><p class="small">Cookie session antara domain berlainan mungkin disekat oleh tetapan SameSite atau perlindungan kuki pihak ketiga. Jika login berjaya tetapi semakan session gagal, itu mungkin isu cookie/CORS — bukan semestinya kata laluan salah. Jangan masukkan kata laluan sebenar di laman yang tidak dipercayai.</p></section>
</main><script>
(()=>{const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),workerInput=$('worker'),passwordInput=$('password'),output=$('output'),status=$('status'),buttons=[$('login'),$('session'),$('logout')];
function setStatus(message,kind='warn'){status.className='status '+kind;status.replaceChildren();const dot=document.createElement('span');dot.className='dot';const t=document.createElement('span');t.textContent=message;status.append(dot,t)}
function log(title,details){const time=new Date().toLocaleTimeString();output.textContent=`[${time}] ${title}\n${typeof details==='string'?details:JSON.stringify(details,null,2)}\n\n`+output.textContent}
function baseUrl(){const raw=workerInput.value.trim().replace(/\/+$/,'');const u=new URL(raw);if(u.protocol!=='https:')throw Error('Gunakan URL Worker HTTPS.');return raw}
async function request(path,options={}){const response=await fetch(baseUrl()+path,{method:options.method||'GET',mode:'cors',credentials:'include',headers:options.body?{'Content-Type':'application/json'}:undefined,body:options.body?JSON.stringify(options.body):undefined,cache:'no-store'});const raw=await response.text();let data;try{data=raw?JSON.parse(raw):null}catch{data=raw}log(`${options.method||'GET'} ${path} → HTTP ${response.status}`,data);return{response,data}}
async function run(action){buttons.forEach(b=>b.disabled=true);setStatus('Sedang menguji…','warn');try{const r=await action();if(r.response.ok&&r.data&&r.data.ok!==false)setStatus('Permintaan berjaya · HTTP '+r.response.status,'good');else setStatus('Worker membalas · HTTP '+r.response.status,'warn')}catch(e){log('Ralat pelayar / rangkaian',{message:e?.message||String(e),diagnosis:'Jika Failed to fetch atau NetworkError, semak CORS, URL Worker dan sama ada halaman ujian dibuka melalui HTTPS.'});setStatus('Permintaan gagal — semak log','bad')}finally{buttons.forEach(b=>b.disabled=false)}}
$('login').addEventListener('click',()=>run(async()=>{const password=passwordInput.value;if(!password)throw Error('Masukkan kata laluan ujian dahulu.');try{return await request('/login',{method:'POST',body:{password}})}finally{passwordInput.value=''}}));
$('session').addEventListener('click',()=>run(()=>request('/session')));$('logout').addEventListener('click',()=>run(()=>request('/logout',{method:'POST'})));$('clear').addEventListener('click',()=>{output.textContent='Log dikosongkan.';setStatus('Log dikosongkan','warn')});
})();</script></body></html>
